menuconfig ENABLE_TY_AVI_MEDIA
    bool "Enable local AVI recording and playback"
    depends on TUYA_MODULE_T5
    depends on ENABLE_TUYA_CAMERA
    depends on ENABLE_TAL_IMAGE
    depends on WUKONG_STORAGE_SDCARD
    default n
    help
      Enable video-only MJPEG AVI recording through the shared Wukong camera
      service and callback playback through the Demo UI. Storage mounting,
      directory listing and path management remain owned by the Demo storage
      and filesystem services; AVI media does not own microphone, speaker or
      display hardware.
